connect with influencers  if you want to market your business if  you want people to talk about you  one of the fastest ways to get more word  of mouth is to connect with people who  have audiences  and have them help spread the word hi  i'm evan carmichael i believe that  hungry entrepreneurs deserve help  and today i'm answering the question  from a youtube viewer love you guys  we are toybox hero wrote in to say  i'm a toy collector i have what i think  is a great idea for a home-based  business i would provide a service of  the collectors it's a web-based company  that i would run from home providing a  service it'd be very helpful the toy  collectors  how do i get the word out about my site  set up the site is easy  i've never done it before but getting  traffic is where i seem to have an issue  thanks in advance  so if you're a big toy collector  and you're part of that community and  you know other toy collectors what i  would do  is go and start talking to the people  who can influence other toy collectors  go talk to bloggers go talk to the place  that you buy  all your toys from the different stores  that you go to and get those guys on  board and even  build your system around them i would go  to  my favorite toy store wherever you're  buying most of your stuff from  if you're a collector they probably have  a good relationship with you  let them know what you're doing ask them  to be a tester  get their feedback build it around the  challenges that they're seeing in the  market  and then when you launch it they're  going to be your advocate they're going  to say hey i helped build this thing  and they can tell everybody in their  store make a list  of 10 20 30 key influencers in your  business  in your industry it could be offline  like retail stores  or it could be online with bloggers and  people who are in forums and people who  are talking about these things  and use them to help build your product  get their feedback  and build a product around them most  people  if you call them up and you're genuine  and you say you'd like 15 minutes of  their time because you'd like their  advice  and it's related to toys what they're  passionate about they're going to give  you the time  and they're going to get excited about  this project if you are and when it  launches they're going to spread the  word  if you're trying to get word of mouth  marketing it's great to build it around  your current customers but if you've got  nothing then start working  with connectors people who have a  community  instead of you going out and trying to  get people one by one by one to sign up  use these guys who already have a big  audience  and have them help build your product  from their feedback and then help spread  the word and promote it  here's a quick example i not too long  ago made a line of famous entrepreneur  trading cards  okay we had people like steve jobs and  bill gates  and donald trump and those guys on the  covers of our cards  and what i did was i connected with  famous bloggers so i connected with seth  godin  and i kept with guy kawasaki people who  were influential  in the entrepreneur space that i deal in  and had their own audiences and i asked  him who's your favorite famous  entrepreneur  and we made a card about it and all the  prophets went to support kiva which is a  charity that i support and believe in  and when the cards launched i sent it to  them and we had tim ferriss in the  four-hour work week and guys like seth  go and guy kawasaki and sent them off  the cards  and a lot of them ended up talking about  it and promoting it  so it wasn't just me permanent to my  audience it was them all saying look at  this great project that i was a part of  it's a great cause it's really cool go  check it out  and all of their audiences then came to  me to go check out the cards  and buy them so it's great to have your  own audience  and once you start building your own  community you support them like crazy  you want them to love what you do so  they go off and talk about you over  deliver like crazy to get word of mouth  going but at the very start  talk to key influencers get them  involved get their support  so that when you launch they'll help  promote you spread the word  and hopefully it'll catch like wildfire  good luck great question  for those of you watching like the video  you know the drill thumbs up below thank  you guys so much and hey i want to hear  from you you like this video you have a  comment please leave it below  it makes my day when i see those come in  and if you have a question for your  business please leave it in the comment  section below and i will make a video  response for you thank you guys i'll see  you soon

